{
    "lesson": 6,
    "title": [
        "An Introduction to the School",
        "学校简介"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "I'm Mrs. Thompson and I'm the headteacher of this international primary school.",
                "我是汤普森夫人，这所国际小学的校长。"
            ],
            [
                "Let me give you an introduction to our school.",
                "让我给你介绍一下我们的学校。"
            ],
            [
                "Students usually get to school around 8:20 a.m.",
                "学生通常在上午8:20左右到达学校。"
            ],
            [
                "If they arrive after 8:30 a.m., they will be marked late.",
                "如果他们在上午8:30之后到达，就会被标记为迟到。"
            ],
            [
                "Before the morning lessons, teachers give various tasks to those schoolchildren to do for the day.",
                "在上午课程开始前，老师们会给那些小学生一天要完成的各种任务。"
            ],
            [
                "These tasks could be finished by themselves or in pairs.",
                "这些任务可以由他们自己或两人一组完成。"
            ],
            [
                "During the courses of the day, students will take part in all the subjects: reading, writing, maths, science, and social studies.",
                "在一天的课程中，学生将参加所有科目：阅读、写作、数学、科学和社会研究。"
            ],
            [
                "The class timetable is written on the board.",
                "课程表写在黑板上。"
            ],
            [
                "In the blocks of Language Arts, students are given reading instructions about the articles in their textbooks, as well as practice in spelling, handwriting and vocabulary.",
                "在语言艺术板块，学生们会得到关于教科书中文章的阅读指导，以及拼写、书写和词汇方面的练习。"
            ],
            [
                "In the maths class, teachers give a mini-lesson and then students have 40 minutes of group or independent work.",
                "在数学课上，老师先进行简短讲解，然后学生进行40分钟的小组或独立作业。"
            ],
            [
                "The last 10 minutes is used to summarise what was learnt and prepare for further learning.",
                "最后10分钟用于总结所学内容并为进一步学习做准备。"
            ],
            [
                "Science classes include the content of beginner level biology, geography, physics and chemistry.",
                "科学课程包括初级水平的生物、地理、物理和化学内容。"
            ],
            [
                "Students need to pass all the final tests to get their diplomas.",
                "学生需要通过所有期末考试才能获得毕业文凭。"
            ],
            [
                "At the beginning of a new school term, we invite alumni of different nationalities who graduated from top colleges and universities to give lectures.",
                "在新学期开始时，我们邀请从顶尖学院和大学毕业的不同国籍的校友来举办讲座。"
            ],
            [
                "We hope that students can better find out their interests and explore their future.",
                "我们希望学生能更好地发现自己的兴趣并探索他们的未来。"
            ],
            [
                "The school day usually ends around 3 p.m.",
                "上学日通常在下午3点左右结束。"
            ],
            [
                "Before going home, children often finish the jobs like cleaning the desks, putting paper materials and dictionaries back on the bookshelf, putting pencils, pens, rulers and rubbers in the schoolbags.",
                "回家前，孩子们经常完成诸如清洁课桌、把纸质材料和字典放回书架、把铅笔、钢笔、尺子和橡皮放进书包等工作。"
            ],
            [
                "In the end, homework is given out and recorded in every student's notebook.",
                "最后，家庭作业会分发并记录在每个学生的笔记本上。"
            ]
        ]
    },
